# Patterns to ignore when building packages.
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
# NOT *.tgz — see agent-harness-tenant/.helmignore's comment: Helm's chart
# loader respects .helmignore on install/upgrade/template too, not just
# packaging, so a blanket *.tgz here would silently break any dependency
# this chart vendors under charts/ in the future (none today).
